@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Blogs
	Frontend testing for the www blogspage

Scenario: View Recent Blog Entry Index
	End users should be able to view all recent blogs on the blogs page.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "blog"
	And I accept all cookies
	Then I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "1" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "2" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "3" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "4" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "5" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "6" in the blog index

Scenario: View Recent Liferay Experience Blog Entry Index
	End users should be able to view all recent blogs on the Liferay Experience blogs page. 

	Given I go to the www page with the url "blog"
	And I accept all cookies
	And I click on the "Liferay Experience" category link
	Then I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "1" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "2" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "3" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "4" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "5" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "6" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "7" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "8" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "9" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "10" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "11" in the blog index
	And I should be able to view the blog entry in the position "12" in the blog index

